OL,3,ATrump says AI safety fears a 'hoax' as
OL,4,Ahe rejects calls for greater safeguards
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said
OL,7,Ffears about the safety of artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) are a "hoax", as he
OL,9,Fcriticised calls to have more
OL,10,Fguardrails in place for the fast-moving
OL,11,Ftechnology.
OL,13,FIt comes after Jack Clark, co-founder
OL,14,Fof AI giant Anthropic, told the BBC
OL,15,Fthat a "kill switch" that can be
OL,16,Fchecked by a third party may need to be
OL,17,Fmandatory for the industry.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,116,105,200,300,0,100
